      "tldr": "Update legal directory profiles for Sample Firm to ensure accurate information, tracking, and new ad copy.",
      "description": "Update legal directory profiles for Sample Firm to ensure accurate information, tracking, and new ad copy.\n\nRefresh ad copy on Justia and FindLaw for placements already paid for. Add or revise URL and content tracking from these pages so leads and performance are easier to measure. Review, update, or cancel contracts as needed.\n\n**Dedicated HubSpot phone for directories:** Buy and label a new HubSpot Calling DID as CH-DIRS. Put that number on Justia, FindLaw, and Avvo call buttons and profile phone fields so directory clicks ring HubSpot and set `pl_lead_source` = Directories. Do not reuse 555-010-0000 or CH-YELP on those profiles. Public site and ads still use 555-010-0000 unless the owner says otherwise.\n\nResearch similar sites and start organic or free testing for comparison and stronger brand presence. Add matching lead-source values in HubSpot and MyCase.\n\nDirectories: Justia, FindLaw, and Avvo. Pick which to prioritize from the brand audit Data tab.",
